WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:06.560
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:07.560
"'The sound of splashing surf in my ears...

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.960
"'Memories of a hot summer..."'

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.270
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:45.180
Fine with me! You can
have me anyway you like!

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:48.720
Momo-chan, I do love you!

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:53.600
As the second best, right?

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:55.000
For now.

00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:59.270
Second best for now.

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:03.440
But someday, l'll be first
in your heart, Okayasu.

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:10.370
"'Pure Love, Straight Ahead!"'

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:18.340
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:18.740
Well, let's think...

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:20.080
Become a more beautiful woman!

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:22.080
Polish your skills!

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.080
What does that mean, "'polish your skills?"'

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:26.420
Like, having lots you can talk about...

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:29.410
Or finding a hobby you have
in common with him!

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:34.090
Is that about all there is?

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:38.190
lsn't there some way l can
make Okayasu love me right now?

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.430
There's gonna be trouble over this!

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:44.420
That's gotta be her!

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:47.570
What's all the excitement about?

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:51.040
Sae!

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.940
"'Disciplinary Office"'

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.450
You've put us in a terrible position,
appearing in a nasty magazine like this.

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:58.780
How could you have done this!

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:00.720
Aren't you going to say anything?

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:05.390
You've got it wrong. That's not me!

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:09.390
I mean, to be sure, it's my face...
but the rest isn't me!

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:11.060
You mean...

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:12.820
This is a composite photo?

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:18.730
But I'm sure everyone is going
to think it really is me!

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:23.640
Having everyone see this photo
makes me so ashamed, I could die!

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:30.410
Did you hear? Kashiwagi got off
without any punishment.

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.750
That's not really her, is it?

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:35.080
Huh? Is this for real?

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:37.090
It really is Sae-chan, isn't it?

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:39.250
Why would she do such a thing?

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:44.860
"'Silence during the test!
No cheating!"'

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:50.430
Pencils down!

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.100
--Thank heavens!
--It's over!

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:53.770
I did bad on that one!

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:59.780
Sae didn't come today. I wonder if she's
too embarrassed because of the photo...

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:02.710
I'd say that's not true of Sae-chan,
of all people.

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:06.720
This is bad. At this rate,
she's gonna flunk out.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:09.390
What?! You're really going to see Ryo?

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:10.390
Mm-hmm.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:15.550
You really are too nice, Momo-chan.
Are you that worried about Sae-chan?

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:19.060
I- it's not that I really care about Sae...

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:20.400
What?

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.590
That's what I really love
about you, Momo-chan!

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.940
This is good enough.
l won't ask for the world,

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:32.840
so, please, God, let me keep
this relationship with Okayasu...

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:37.080
Huh?

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.080
Toji?

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:40.080
What are you doing here?

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:43.750
I thought I'd ask
Okayasu's brother about Kashiwagi...

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.350
You, too, Toji?

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:49.760
Oh, my! That's...

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:50.760
Sae!

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:52.430
That's really nice of you.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.760
Ryo-sama, you'd said
you wanted one like that.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:56.770
But it must've cost a lot.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:57.770
No!

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:00.700
Don't worry! I'm rich these days!

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.710
Then I'll accept it.

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:03.900
Please do!

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:07.040
Shall we go on a date tonight?

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.710
Oh, Ryo-sama!

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:10.710
What on earth are you doing, Sae?!

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:13.120
Don't tell me you've taken
an illicit side job

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.050
so you can support the likes of him!

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:17.720
"'Support?"' You'll tarnish my reputation!

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:21.060
Don't make false accusations!
I'm doing this because I want to!

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:24.730
Sae! Don't you know
what kind of filth this guy is?!

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:28.060
At best he's going to use you
and then throw you away!

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:30.400
Don't bad-mouth Ryo-sama!

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:34.400
Are you nuts?! Why are you
standing up for the likes of him?!

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.030
Because I love him!

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:40.080
What are you saying?!

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:43.410
Here you're dating Toji, and you think
he's going to let you do this?

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.470
Toji and I broke up!

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:50.090
So... that's that.

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:51.420
Come on, let's go.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:53.760
Yes, Ryo-sama!

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:55.090
Kashiwagi...

00:05:57.090 --> 00:06:00.100
Do you think Sae is really
in love with your brother?

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:01.030
Who knows?

00:06:01.030 --> 00:06:03.030
But what about Toji?

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:06.370
That's Toji's problem.

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:10.740
Now that tests are over,
let's get lovey-dovey!

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:14.730
Wanna go to my house now?

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:17.810
No way!

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:22.720
Why not?! Why not! Come on,
let's play lovey-dovey! Lovey-dovey...

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:27.060
Playing lovey-dovey at his house
means only one thing...

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:32.400
Fine with me! You can
have me anyway you like!

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:36.000
l said that because l wanted
to tie Okayasu to me,

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.990
but what if that's how it really turns out?

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:45.230
I know! Momo-chan, let's go away together!

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:49.750
Remember? We talked about it before!
Summer vacation is almost here.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:54.080
Let's go to the sea!
The sea is where we first met!

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.090
Whacha think?

00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:58.090
Mm-hmm.

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:02.690
But going away together
means he's got nasty designs...

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.450
Don't worry.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:11.000
Until you feel the same way
about it, Momo-chan,

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.700
I'm not going to do
what you're thinking about.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.700
Okayasu...

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.640
Let's have a fun trip.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.040
And make lots of good memories.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.710
Mm-hmm.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:27.910
l take back what l said.
He really cares for me a lot...

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.710
l'm... l'm so happy!

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:39.400
A trip! ls an inn better, or a hotel?

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.690
l wonder which one Okayasu would prefer?

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:45.930
Okaya-!

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:51.070
Yikes! On impulse l just hid...

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:54.410
Summer vacation's no fun.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:55.740
Why not?

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:59.420
Because I won't be able to
see you every day, Misao-chan.

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:02.690
Listen! Let's go somewhere
during the summer!

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:05.690
You silly boy. You're asking
the wrong woman.

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:09.620
l understand... at least
my head understands...

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:19.370
Why am l letting this get to me?

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:24.370
Even though l'm sick to death of it...
Even though l'm consumed with jealousy!

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:26.710
lt's a lie that being second
is good enough...

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:31.770
l want him to be nice to me alone!
l want him to love me more deeply!

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:35.850
l want him to look only at me...

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:38.920
Momo-chan!

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:44.060
A job?

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:47.060
Yeah, at the convenience store
by the station.

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:50.470
Wanna work together
during the summer break?

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:53.400
It's perfect for earning
the money for our trip,

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:57.070
and if we're working at the same place,
we can see each other every day.

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:58.270
Mm-hmm.

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:04.780
Thank you!

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:08.680
Please come again!

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:13.020
Good thing! l almost
started to blame Okayasu.

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:16.030
But being jealous will get me nowhere.

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:20.360
lf l become a better woman,
someday Okayasu will come to me.

00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:22.390
Thank you very much!

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:26.130
Welcome!

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:30.040
Ah?

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:35.040
Oh, my! Momo-chan!
You're working at a place like this?!

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:37.380
Can't help it. I'm an impoverished student.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:43.050
I couldn't stand a job
that only paid 800 yen an hour!

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:46.390
Don't tell me you're involved
in some weird job again!

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:49.730
Well, actually. I'm just about
to start my film shoot.

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:50.730
Shoot?

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:55.060
I asked Ryo-sama if he knew
of any good part-time job for me

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:58.730
and he got right on it! He's so reliable!

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:00.740
I know he loves me so much!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:04.410
Oh! I don't have time to
stand around chatting! Let's see...

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:06.080
I'll take this.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.410
500 yen.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:11.080
That stupid brother found you
this job?! Is it safe?!

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:18.090
Don't be jealous! I think it's a promo
for a new computer game. And I'm the lead!

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:20.420
Thanks!

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:23.430
See you later!

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.830
A promo for a game, huh?

00:10:28.430 --> 00:10:30.100
--We're taking off now!
--We're taking off now!

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.430
Thanks a lot!

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:32.770
I'm pooped.

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:35.770
Standing up all day is hard work...

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:38.770
Okay, Sae-chan! Come running
across the street...

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:40.110
Okay!

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:43.450
Sae?

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:46.450
I guess she really did have a film shoot.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:49.790
Okay, cut! Good work, Sae-chan!

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.120
Thanks!

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:53.120
You're really into this!

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:55.460
Hmm... I've seen that guy
someplace before...

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:56.130
What?

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.460
The next scene you'll be doing with me.

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:00.130
I'm looking forward to it!

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:03.070
Ah! I remember! It's Pokki Suzuki!

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:04.070
Who's that?

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:06.740
--Let's go to the next location.
--Okay!

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:10.360
This is very bad!
This isn't a shoot for a game!

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:30.430
You're certainly enthusiastic.

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:34.760
Well, I want to look
as pretty as I can, and...

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:35.760
And what?

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:39.360
I want to do well because
Ryo-sama got me this job!

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:42.100
Yes?

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:45.110
Hello? Sae?

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:46.440
Momo-chan?

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:48.110
Get outta that car! Quick!

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:48.780
Huh?

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:53.450
Don't you realize? The guys in that car
are the staff of a porno video company!

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:58.250
We saw them filming you,
and Okayasu figured it out!

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:03.390
Oh, Momo-chan!

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:06.730
Are you really that envious
that I'm in a video?

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:09.400
In that case, you should get into this, too!

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:11.730
Who wants to be in a porno video?!

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:14.070
How rude! What proof do you have?!

00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:16.740
Okayasu, the very king of porno,
is saying it!

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:20.330
One video that he watched recently
had that actor who's with you!

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:27.110
They're tricking you!
Anyway, just hurry and get outta that car!

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:33.420
We're here!

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:35.650
Time to put in another performance...

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:41.100
...trying to reach is either out of
the calling area or is turned off...

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:43.730
"'Sae"'
...trying to reach is either out of
the calling area or is turned off...

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:44.100
...trying to reach is either out of
the calling area or is turned off...

00:12:44.100 --> 00:12:46.100
Darn! I can't reach her!

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:48.440
Forget it! Let her be, let her be.

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:51.440
If Sae-chan doesn't want to listen,
nothing you can say will help.

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:54.110
She's got to learn her lesson the hard way.

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:55.780
But...

00:12:55.780 --> 00:12:59.510
No! I can't let this go! I'm going to go
ask your idiot brother where they are!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:02.750
Momo-chan?

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:06.520
Well? Shall we get started?

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:11.730
What is this?! This isn't a
promo for a computer game?!

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:14.060
Who told you that?!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:17.730
No! This is not what
I signed on for! I'm leaving!

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.400
Whadaya mean?!

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.400
I can't let you! Not this late!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:24.070
Ryo-sama would never get me
involved in a job like this!

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:25.070
Stop her!

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:28.080
Com'ere, you!

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:33.750
Open up! If you don't,
I'm gonna break the glass!

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:34.420
Yeah?

00:13:34.420 --> 00:13:36.080
Ah! Ryo-sama!

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.390
Something's funny!

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:40.090
When I got here I found out
this was filming for a porno video!

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:43.430
Oh... didn't I mention that?

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:47.430
Oh, dear. I thought you
were okay with all that...

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:50.430
We must've had a miscommunication.

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.430
If you don't want to do it,
you don't have to.

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:53.770
Ryo-sama...

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:55.100
But if you quit...

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:58.130
...never show your face to me again.

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:06.510
Hey, you! I told you to come outta there!

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:09.580
Hold it a minute! Momo-chan!

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:14.720
"'Sae"'

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:15.060
Sae!

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:17.060
Hello, Sae?!

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:23.730
Momo-chan? It's exactly
as you said it was... I... I...

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:26.070
Sae, where are you now?

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:30.100
Mm-hmm... Mm-hmm...
Okay, we'll come rescue you right away!

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:39.410
But if you quit,
never show your face to me again.

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:42.110
How could you, Ryo-sama?

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:48.420
I've almost got it...

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:50.250
Hey, you're pretty clever.

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:59.970
You've sure been a lot of trouble...

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.710
Don't worry. We'll make you look pretty.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:06.110
You'll be really popular!

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.710
No!

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:12.380
Delivery of the pizza you ordered!

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:14.380
Just a minute!

00:15:14.380 --> 00:15:16.440
I wonder who ordered one?

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:19.740
Here's your receipt!

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:23.390
Get 'em!

00:15:23.390 --> 00:15:25.050
Who are you guys?!

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:31.800
Hey! Don't step on the equipment!

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:34.200
Withdraw!

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:45.470
Our Human Wave Tactic
was a great success!

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:53.420
Thank you, everyone! And be sure
to keep this under your hat, okay?

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:55.090
--Sure!
--Sure!
--Sure!

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:57.650
Sae, do you want to say a word of thanks?

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:01.960
I never asked you all to come get me.

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:08.040
Listen, you!

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:10.400
Let it go... for now...

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:19.040
You're hurt, Sae...

00:16:23.050 --> 00:16:26.110
Anyway, at least you're all right.

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:37.730
T- thank you...

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:48.410
What the hell do you
think you were doing?!

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:51.750
Were you just going to put Sae-chan
to work so she could support you?

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:56.340
You're a creep! A scumbag!
A piece of shit! You're human filth!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.050
Ryo-sama?

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:06.700
When you told me you loved me,
was that a lie? Were you just using me?

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:09.700
I trusted you!

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:12.370
To be sure, I'm not such a nice fella.

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:16.710
I'm sorry. What I did was
sort of shock therapy, Sae-chan,

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:17.710
to try to get you to open your eyes,

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:21.380
and start you on the right road...

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:24.470
Good-bye. Thanks for everything.

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:37.730
--Ryo-sama!
--Where are you going?!

00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:40.730
I'm going to... I'm going
to go with Ryo-sama!

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:45.070
You know that was just a bunch of lies!
You'll just go through hell again!

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:50.070
I know! I know it! But... I can't help it!

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:52.740
I love him!

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:54.110
Sae...

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:01.350
Shouldn't you have
stopped her, Momo-chan?

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:05.350
I couldn't stop her. Even when
you're wrong, even when you're hurt,

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:08.020
until you come to your own realization,
you'll do what you want, right?

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:10.030
I love him!

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:14.030
l understand that.
Because l'm the same way...

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.030
What's wrong?

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:17.370
Oh, nothing.

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:20.640
Sometimes l feel anxious.
l keep thinking

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:24.710
that if we're always together,
we'll someday be true lovers.

00:18:24.710 --> 00:18:29.770
But will it really happen?
ls there no chance for me?

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.040
--Welcome!
--Welcome!

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:35.280
Sae!

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:44.730
That's 420 yen.

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:46.390
I don't need a bag.

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:47.730
Okay...

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:48.990
And...

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:53.400
You're giving them to us?

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:57.070
To thank you for yesterday,
and to apologize for everything.

00:18:57.070 --> 00:19:00.510
I've done a lot of mean things
to you, Momo-chan,

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:02.340
and you even said you'd have
nothing more to do with me,

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:06.110
yet you came to help me. I was very happy.

00:19:07.020 --> 00:19:11.350
I'm truly grateful. I'm sorry
for all the trouble I've caused.

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:12.690
Is this for real?

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:14.750
I think it's gonna snow...

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:21.250
I think Sae-chan finally
understands how you feel, Momo-chan.

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:23.700
That's so good!

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:25.260
Truly!

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:28.370
Done eating?

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:30.040
Are you still here?

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:32.170
I have to talk to you, Momo-chan.

00:19:47.060 --> 00:19:49.720
Misao-chan! You came to see me!

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:53.400
I just saw Adachi-san
and Kashiwagi-san outside...

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:55.060
Is there some kind of trouble?

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:59.730
No, no! You've gotta hear this!
You'll die!

00:19:59.730 --> 00:20:02.140
Sae-chan had a big change of heart,

00:20:02.140 --> 00:20:04.410
and to thank us, she treated us
to some ice cream.

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:08.740
She was all hunched over and said she was
sorry for all the trouble she'd caused!

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:12.080
I can't believe that was
the result of her dating Ryo!

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:15.750
It's sort of like the saying,
"'fight fire with fire!"' Right?

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:18.090
Oh? Well, that's good...

00:20:18.090 --> 00:20:21.180
Well, we'll see what really happens...

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:24.390
Misao-chan?

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:29.560
Misao-chan!

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:35.440
You probably think I'm really stupid.

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:36.770
Well... sort of.

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:40.780
Even I think so. I realized
he made quite a fool out of me.

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:46.450
But it's the first time I've ever
truly fallen in love before.

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:48.350
I was thinking that maybe
if I stay by his side,

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:51.450
I can change Ryo-sama
for the better a little bit.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:52.120
What?

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:55.210
Nothing. You don't sound like Sae.

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:59.130
And strangely, now that I've learned
what it's like to really be in love,

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:04.070
I understand how you've felt, Momo-chan.
Especially how it hurts to be betrayed.

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:08.400
I did some really awful things
to you, Momo-chan.

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:10.740
I'm sorry.

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:12.470
Sae...

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:17.080
On a diet?!

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:20.750
It's not helpful to do something stupid
and make yourself anemic.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:21.750
But...

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:27.090
Men like tiny, slender girls
like Kashiwagi-san, don't they?

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:32.430
Not all men! I like plump girls, too.

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:34.190
Thank you.

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:39.100
Anyway, lie down here
until you're feeling better.

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:43.040
And one more thing:
Promise you won't diet again. Right?

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:00.950
A diet! For heavens' sake...

00:22:14.070 --> 00:22:15.430
Okayasu!

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:21.410
Momo-chan...

00:22:37.230 --> 00:22:43.230
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:52.910
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:55.910
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.910 --> 00:23:02.520
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:08.860
Where can we go

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:18.530
where we can all be

00:23:18.530 --> 00:23:21.200
under the same sky?

00:23:21.200 --> 00:23:29.540
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.540 --> 00:23:36.220
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:42.560
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.560 --> 00:23:49.900
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:57.530
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.510 --> 00:24:07.850
Okayasu... lf l wait for you...
lf l hang in there and wait for you...

00:24:07.850 --> 00:24:11.190
Perhaps someday you'll come to love me?

00:24:11.190 --> 00:24:14.750
Next time on Peach Girl,
"'A Summer Seduction"'
